'''Chroma Weapons''' are color alternating versions of several [[Godly Weapons|godlies]].

In [[Season 1]], every [[Boxes|box]] was given an unboxable chroma version of the [[Godly Weapons|godly]] [[Weapons|weapon]] contained inside, although, the chances of unboxing a chroma are extremely low. Other chromas currently not obtained through unboxing are the [[Chroma Seer]], which is obtainable through [[crafting]], or, although now only obtainable through [[trading]], the [[Chroma Evergun]], [[Chroma Bauble]], [[Chroma Sunset]], [[Chroma Raygun]], [[Chroma Snowcannon]], [[Chroma Ornament]], [[Chroma Snowstorm]], [[Chroma Blizzard]], [[Chroma Sweet|Chroma Sweet,]] [[Chroma Treat]], [[Chroma Beachy]], [[Chroma Sands]], [[Chroma Emberbow]], [[Chroma Emberscythe]], [[Chroma Embersickle]], [[Chroma Mortal]], and [[Chroma Immortal]] which were originally obtainable through gifting, tiers, or gamepasses during their respective events. There are currently 46 chroma weapons in the game.

