==Trivia== 
*[[Chroma Boneblade]], [[Chroma Gingerblade]], [[Chroma Candleflame]], [[Chroma Swirly Gun]], [[Chroma Elderwood Blade]], [[Chroma Cookiecane]], [[Chroma Traveler's Gun]], [[Chroma Evergreen]], [[Chroma Watergun]], [[Chroma Vampire's Gun]], [[Chroma Constellation]], [[Chroma Sunrise]], [[Chroma Alienbeam]], [[Chroma Snow Dagger]], [[Chroma Heart Wand]], and [[Chroma Icecream]] are the only chromas that cannot be unboxed anymore, as their events have since ended.
*Most of the old Chroma Weapons lost a massive amount of [[value]] after [[The Duping Glitch (2019)]], while newer ones (going from [[Chroma Candleflame]] onwards) lost a massive amount of value after [[The Candleflame Glitch (2021)]] and [[The Duping Glitch (2022)]].
*[[Chroma Boneblade]] and [[Chroma Gingerblade]] were the first Chroma Weapons ever introduced to the game, back in late 2018. 
*[[Chroma Emberbow]] and [[Chroma Emberscythe]] were the first Chroma [[Ancient Weapons|ancients]] to be added to the game, during the [[Halloween Event 2026|2026 Halloween Event]]
